{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980560/extras/b323d757c221eea97bcbb21f8ad84a06.avif?t=1759227755\" width=618 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blindfold Chess</strong> challenges you to play entirely from memory. Sharpen your board visualization, calculation skills, and mental stamina as you prepare for true blindfold play. Face powerful AI opponents or compete online against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980560/extras/0d8f0017917eba626020b573686f7199.poster.avif?t=1759227755\" width=800 height=530 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980560/extras/0d8f0017917eba626020b573686f7199.webm?t=1759227755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980560/extras/0d8f0017917eba626020b573686f7199.mp4?t=1759227755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980560/extras/5c565dd95fca206b8ccd3981c1df51e4.avif?t=1759227755\" width=647 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your skills with dedicated blindfold training modes: practice coordinates, track invisible pieces, and sharpen your board visualization step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980560/extras/2e781fb604c9f596c37e1edf75e982bc.poster.avif?t=1759227755\" width=800 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980560/extras/2e781fb604c9f596c37e1edf75e982bc.webm?t=1759227755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980560/extras/2e781fb604c9f596c37e1edf75e982bc.mp4?t=1759227755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each excersize strengthens different aspects of blindfold chess \u2014 from quick recognition to sustained calculation \u2014 giving you practical ways to improve before facing real opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980560/extras/cdb30b802f7408f22b3193bfec7280e3.poster.avif?t=1759227755\" width=800 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980560/extras/cdb30b802f7408f22b3193bfec7280e3.webm?t=1759227755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980560/extras/cdb30b802f7408f22b3193bfec7280e3.mp4?t=1759227755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve mastered the training modes, dive into full matches. Face off against AI of increasing strength or battle online opponents to sharpen your chess like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique blindfold chess gameplay</strong> with multiple training modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard notation input</strong> for authentic blindfold practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battles against Stockfish AI</strong> across varying strengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online 1v1 lobbies</strong> for competitive blindfold matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist, atmospheric style</strong> with focused background music</p></l